{"id":"u-b8c2c594-42e0-4944-8d89-3b2a92052a0e","src":"community","title":"Blood & Skill - Superset Hybrid (4xPPL/FullBody)","author":"Ventsislav Rachev","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/rY48gO-blood-and-skill-superset-hybrid-4xpplfullbody","desc":"Blood & Skill is a hybrid strength and skill program designed to maximize muscular growth, neurological efficiency, and bodyweight mastery using minimal equipment. Inspired by the intensity-driven training philosophy of Dorian Yates and Mike Mentzer, it emphasizes high-effort, low-volume sessions built around 2 sets to technical failure per exercise. This approach ensures optimal stimulus with maximal recovery, making it ideal for natural lifters.\n\nThe program is split into four weekly sessions:\n\nPush (Day 1)\n\nPull (Day 2)\n\nLegs (Day 3)\n\nFull Body Skill & Calisthenics Day (Day 4)\n\n\nDays 1–3 combine weighted compound lifts using an EZ bar, adjustable dumbbells, and parallettes, merging progressive overload with controlled tempo and form. Each session targets fundamental movement patterns and includes accessory work as needed.\n\nDay 4 is flexible and skill-focused, aimed at developing bodyweight strength through front lever, planche, pistol squat, or handstand progressions—based on your level and goals.\n\nThis program is built for those who want to train hard, smart, and with purpose, developing a powerful, capable, and athletic physique without needing a gym.","level":["Intermediate"],"goals":["Bodyweight Fitness","Athletics","Women's"],"equipment":["Garage Gym"],"minutes":50,"joins":2,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-03-15T19:16:29.740Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Chest & Back + Core","Day 2 — Legs + Delts + Neck+Ab","Day 3 -Shoulders + Arms + Corе","FB calisthenics progressions"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"ss":[{"n":"Decline Push Up","sets":[{"r":0,"x":2}]},{"n":"Pullover (EZ Bar)","sets":[{"r":0,"x":2}]}]},{"ss":[{"n":"Dip (Bodyweight)","sets":[{"r":0,"x":2}]},{"n":"Australian Row (Neutra